    "result_text": "Done. The full suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\nThe change: `AuditOwnerCreated` now injects the `OwnerMapper` (a Spring bean, resolved by type per the OfficeFloor function-injection convention) and appends `membershipLevel` and `membershipNumber` to the create audit line, using the same derivations (`toMembershipLevel`, `toMembershipNumber`) that produce the values in the API response. The previously logged fields \u2014 `id`, `customerCode`, `registrationDate` \u2014 remain.\n\nThe emitted line now reads, e.g.:\n```\nOwner created id=11 customerCode=NSW-16E6609E registrationDate=2026-09-07 membershipLevel=2 membershipNumber=NSW-16E6609E-M26\n```",
